@startuml
title Sequence Diagram for Member 2: Cart Operations (Facade Pattern)
autonumber

actor Client
participant "CartController" as CC
participant "Facade:CartFacade" as CF
participant "Mgmt:CartManagementService" as CMS
participant "Item:CartItemService" as CIS

== Thêm sản phẩm vào giỏ ==
Client -> CC : Thêm vào giỏ (variantId, qty, ...)
activate CC

CC -> CF : addItemWithOptions(customer, ...)
activate CF
CF -> CIS : addItemWithOptions(customer, ...)
activate CIS
CIS -> CMS : getOrCreateActiveCart(customer)
CMS --> CIS : cart
CIS -> CIS : Tạo CartItem & Toppings
CIS --> CF : cartItem
deactivate CIS
CF --> CC : cartItem
deactivate CF

CC --> Client : Redirect to /cart
deactivate CC

== Lấy thông tin giỏ hàng ==
Client -> CC : Xem giỏ hàng
activate CC

CC -> CF : listItems(customer)
activate CF
CF -> CIS : listItems(customer)
CIS --> CF : list
deactivate CF

CC -> CF : getCartTotal(customer)
activate CF
CF -> CMS : cartTotal(customer)
CMS --> CF : total
deactivate CF

CC --> Client : Hiển thị trang giỏ hàng
deactivate CC

@enduml
